## with vrachy (breve above) or macron

glyph gr-(alpha|iota|upsilon)-upper-with-breve
ref gr-(alpha|iota|upsilon)-upper
ref breve-above
glyph gr-(alpha|iota|upsilon)-lower-with-breve
ref gr-(alpha|iota|upsilon)-lower
ref breve-above

glyph gr-(alpha|iota|upsilon)-upper-with-macron
ref gr-(alpha|iota|upsilon)-upper
ref mac-above
glyph gr-(alpha|iota|upsilon)-lower-with-macron
ref gr-(alpha|iota|upsilon)-lower
ref mac-above

map Ᾰ = gr-alpha-upper-with-breve
map Ῐ = gr-iota-upper-with-breve
map Ῠ = gr-upsilon-upper-with-breve

map Ᾱ = gr-alpha-upper-with-macron
